3%82%99%201@2x.png"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://ucarecdn.com/cf472b68-9cda-4823-ae26-71916f6a075d/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%9B%E3%82%99%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%82%99%201@2x.png"><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/cf472b68-9cda-4823-ae26-71916f6a075d/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%9B%E3%82%99%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%82%99%201@2x.png" alt=""></picture><div class="gf_hero-overlay" style="background:transparent;opacity:0.2"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1744793583958" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1744793583958" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/c39b7bac-868f-433b-92cb-e624718b99db/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%9B%E3%82%99%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%82%99%207@2x%20_3_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="2161" height="2701" natural-width="2161" natural-height="2701"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1743657236775" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1743657236775"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1743657236829" data-id="1743657236829"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743657241108" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1743657241108" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">【期間限定 クラウドファンディング開催】</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ずっと着ていられる。なのに、きれいめずっと続く。</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">大人のためのTシャツ</h1><div><br></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743657314013" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1743657314013" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">普段着のTシャツに、こんな理想を抱いたことはありませんか？</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">「毎日着ても心地よくて、ちゃんと見えるものが欲しい」</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">「年齢を重ねた今の自分に似合う、上品さがほしい」</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">「何年も着られるクオリティのものが欲しい」</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">この<strong>“大人Tシャツ”</strong>シリーズは、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">そんな思いから生まれました。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">素材には、肌あたりが柔らかく、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">着続けてもへたらない高品質なコットンや混紡素材を使用。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">日常使いに適した丈夫さと、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">空気のような軽さを兼ね備えています。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">型崩れしにくい設計や、洗濯後も美しさを保つ工夫も。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">シルエットは、体のラインを拾いすぎず、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">でも野暮ったくならない絶妙なバランス。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">すっきりと上品な印象をキープしながらも、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">動きやすさや着心地へのこだわりは妥協しません。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">カジュアルになりすぎず、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">かといってかしこまりすぎない。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">デニムにもスラックスにも合い、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">ジャケットのインにも一枚でもきまる。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">着るたびに「これでいい」「これがいい」と思える。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">そんなTシャツです。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><strong>“ずっと着ていられる”心地よさと、</strong></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><strong>“きれいめがずっと続く”品のよさを両立した、</strong></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><strong>大人のTシャツ</strong>です。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743657410385" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1743657410385"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1743646533926" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1743646533926" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="0px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1743646534015" data-id="1743646534015"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743646567222" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1743646567222" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>【世界三大コットン　</strong><strong style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">ギザコットン</strong><strong style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">】</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1749631756264" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1749631756264"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>世界中で広く愛用されている植物由来の素材、コットン。</p><p>KAPOK KNOTがTシャツに用いているのは、</p><p>世界三大コットンのひとつ「ギザコットン」です。</p><p><br></p><p>エジプトのギザ地方を産地とするギザコットンは、</p><p>品質が高く耐久性に優れているため、</p><p>洗濯を繰り返してもへたりにくく、</p><p>その質を保ちながら長くご着用いただけます。</p><p><br></p><p>大量生産・大量廃棄が行われているファッション業界において、</p><p>大切なのは「長く着られる洋服を選ぶ」こと。</p><p>身近な素材を使ったものこそ、こだわりの一着を。</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1750228187254" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1750228187254"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>【ギザコットンを使ったデザインTシャツ3選】</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743646560769" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1743646560769" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1750228594754" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding gf_row-gap-0" data